From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:09:41 +0000
Subject: feat(canvas): support externally-set drawCallback with public
 redraw()

A CanvasView whose drawCallback is set after creation had no way to trigger
a draw, and draw() bailed out while flex layout had not produced a frame.
Add public redraw() and isLayoutFrameDefault(), fall back to the last frame
sent to the native view for the draw size, and stop Compose KuiklyCanvas
from sending an orphan "reset" that wiped drawCallback output.

Fork-Patch: canvas-drawcallback-redraw
Origin: a4b60bd9 67602f91 68552342 418d2389
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

diff --git a/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/ui/KuiklyCanvas.kt b/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/ui/KuiklyCanvas.kt
index 37b7d727af34dcd7607949ba41fee052a0361501..db519f2d9e1a7586e72e3fd9238cb2f50b8fedc0 100644
--- a/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/ui/KuiklyCanvas.kt
+++ b/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/ui/KuiklyCanvas.kt
@@ -76,7 +76,11 @@ internal class KuiklyCanvas : Canvas {
             if (value is CanvasView) {
                 context = CanvasContext(value.renderView!!, value.pagerId, value.nativeRef)
                 densityValue = value.getPager().pagerDensity()
-                value.renderView?.callMethod("reset", "")
+                // 已注册 drawCallback 的 CanvasView 由自身 draw 流程管理 reset 与重填；
+                // 此处补发裸 reset 而无后续指令，会把其已下发的绘制指令清掉（白屏回归）。
+                if (value.drawCallback == null) {
+                    value.renderView?.callMethod("reset", "")
+                }
                 strokeCap = StrokeCap.Butt
             } else {
                 context = null
